# Runs ilmildizi-backup.service every day at 03:20 server time (quiet hours — low
# traffic, won't compete with real requests for disk/CPU). Persistent=true means a backup
# that was missed because the server was off at 03:20 runs as soon as it's back up, instead
# of silently waiting a full day for the next scheduled time.

[Unit]
Description=Daily timer for IlmIldizi backup

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 03:20:00
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
